IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Aiuto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non pensavo che gli spiriti
malvagi esistessero davvero,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
¡Fuera!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Sal de aquí, ogro!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Y dame buena suerte,
si puede ser!

DE:
Husch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Weg da, du Oger!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hoffe, du bringst mir
wenigstens Glück!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Che Setsubun sarebbe se non
si tirassero un po' di fagioli?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Uh... Non ti ho mica fatto male?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Caspitina, scusami, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}I sure hope all this bean throwing
will keep us safe from ogres.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
My arm's getting tired!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Spero che tutto questo tirar fagioli
ci protegga dagli spiriti malvagi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Il mio braccio è stanco morto!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}That didn't do anything?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0010:}}You must
be trying to trick me!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}You can't fool me, ogre!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm gonna
keep throwing beans at you all day!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿No ha funcionado?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¿Es que quieres burlarte de mí?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Pues a mí no me engañas, ogro!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Voy a seguir lanzando habichuelas
todo el día!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}C'est tout l'effet que ça te fait...?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bien essayé, mais je ne suis pas si
naïf !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Tu m'auras pas, l'ogre !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je vais
te bombarder de haricots toute la
journée, s'il le faut !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Cosa? I fagioli non ti fanno nulla?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Non mi imbrogli, spirito
malvagio!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Continuerò
a tirarteli lo stesso.{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hat das etwa nicht funktioniert?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ha, du willst mich doch veralbern!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Mich legst du nicht rein, Oger!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bewerf dich den ganzen Tag
mit Bohnen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Äh, he he he!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Mmmh, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Bohnen sind echt lecker.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Besonders die aus Schokolade.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Äh, he he he!

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Wieso kann man Oger ausgerechnet
mit Bohnen vertreiben?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das versteh ich nicht.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Tus habichuelas son para alejar
la mala suerte?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿O son para comer?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Nunca se sabe. ¡Valen para todo!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Vai via, spiritaccio malvagio, se non
vuoi assaporare i miei fagioli!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0013:}}Uffa!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}} Ho finito le mie scorte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Los ogros no pueden entrar
en mi casa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Fuera de aquí,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Non li voglio gli spiriti malvagi
a casa mia!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vattene via di qua,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Söylemesi {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}tuhaf ama herkes sana {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
fasulye atınca biraz acıdım. {{TAG:0003:0027:}}
İstersen bir süre evimde
saklanabilirsin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
